{"id":"9x47wzy8x7","doi":{"id":"10.17632/9x47wzy8x7.1","status":"allocated","prefix":"10.17632"},"name":"A study of \"Genome-wide CRISPR screens reveal host factors critical for SARS-CoV-2 infection\" by Wei et al. Cell 2020","description":"Identification of host genes essential for SARS-CoV-2 infection may reveal novel therapeutic targets and inform our understanding of COVID-19 pathogenesis. Here, we performed genome-wide CRISPR screens in Vero-E6 cells with SARS-CoV-2, MERS-CoV, bat coronavirus HKU5 expressing the SARS-CoV-1 spike, and VSV expressing the SARS-CoV-2 spike. Together this identifies potential therapeutic targets for SARS-CoV-2 and reveals SARS-lineage specific and pan-coronavirus host factors that regulate susceptibility to highly pathogenic coronaviruses.","version":1,"contributors":[{"profile_id":"180776b1-0ede-3470-b8f1-37117a4cf82f","first_name":"Craig","last_name":"Wilen"}],"files":[{"filename":"Table S1. SARS-CoV-2 genome-wide.xlsx","id":"ed17173b-cac8-44db-9c2c-6d0cc89617ad","content_details":{"id":"6b5bf7c7-d3c2-4db3-9253-04d440585a04","sha256_hash":"239f2935ee505a961b94285de998e074d9524949c311c79c1cff1e37dee5252c","content_type":"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet","size":11574054,"created_date":"2020-10-15T19:21:32.909Z","download_url":"https://data.mendeley.com/public-files/datasets/9x47wzy8x7/files/ed17173b-cac8-44db-9c2c-6d0cc89617ad/file_downloaded","view_url":"https://data.mendeley.com/public-files/datasets/9x47wzy8x7/files/ed17173b-cac8-44db-9c2c-6d0cc89617ad/file_viewed","download_expiry_time":"2126-11-07T17:54:33.406780024Z"},"metrics":{"downloads":0,"previews":0},"size":11574054,"status":"COMPLETED"},{"filename":"Table S2. Vero-E6 coronaviruses genome-wide CRISPR screens.xlsx","id":"ed1468be-2746-4209-ad29-3595724bc7e7","content_details":{"id":"722f762a-0596-4a1c-9374-865b73c7c404","sha256_hash":"bf333e2d5afe870eb993393833045bb8a73a165e7c95435e32b9fc8062a659c3","content_type":"application/vnd.openxml